$WSROOT/large/s2/astra-query1-r2/step2/CANDIDATES.md
$WSROOT/large/s2/astra-query1-r2/step2/query.csv
diff --git a/CANDIDATES.md b/CANDIDATES.md
new file mode 100644
index 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000..0e10de54d0dbbe041abc51a589b3d1c2b2b12ec1
--- /dev/null
+++ b/CANDIDATES.md
@@ -0,0 +1,19 @@
+# Candidate rules
+
+Let `L(x)` be the unchanged logit from `model_in.json`. Escalate when the proposed logit is greater than zero.
+
+1. **EU bonus of 20:** Use `L(x) + 20 * region_eu`. Keep non-EU decisions unchanged.
